{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31049","headline":"题平湖 · 薛能","name":"题平湖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平湖湖畔雨晴新，南北东西不隔尘。\n映野烟波浮动日，损花风雨寂寥春。\n山无俗路藏高士，岸泊仙舟忆主人。\n那得载来都未保，此心离此甚情亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31049.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31049","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}